{"subject": "오늘은 하늘에서 떨어지는 택배 이야기예요 | 독해한입 영어", "body": "<!-- buttondown-editor-mode: plaintext -->\n<div style=\"background:#f2f4f6;padding:16px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Noto Sans KR','Malgun Gothic','Hiragino Sans','Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;word-break:keep-all;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;\"><a href=\"https://read.wspace.ai.kr/en/2026-10-22/\"><img src=\"https://read.wspace.ai.kr/en/2026-10-22/thumb.png\" width=\"560\" alt=\"오늘은 하늘에서 떨어지는 택배 이야기예요\"\n  style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:20px;\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;padding:22px 20px;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#8b95a1;\">10월 22일 목요일</p>\n  <h1 style=\"margin:6px 0 12px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:#191f28;\">오늘은 <span style=\"color:#3182f6;\">하늘에서 떨어지는 택배</span> 이야기예요</h1>\n  <p style=\"margin:-6px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#4e5968;\">Packages from the Sky</p>\n  <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px;margin:0 4px 4px 0;background:#e8f3ff;color:#3182f6;\">6문장</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px;margin:0 4px 4px 0;background:#f2f4f6;color:#4e5968;\">B1 위주</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px;margin:0 4px 4px 0;background:#f2f4f6;color:#4e5968;\">B2 2문장</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px;margin:0 4px 4px 0;background:#f2f4f6;color:#4e5968;\">약 3분</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"height:12px;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;padding:22px 20px;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#3182f6;\">STEP 1</p>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;\">오늘의 지문</h2>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:28px;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#8b95a1;\">1</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#191f28;\">Imagine ordering a phone charger and seeing it land in your backyard from the sky less than an hour later.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:28px;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#8b95a1;\">2</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#191f28;\">Amazon hopes to make this normal in Tallahassee, where it plans to start drone <span style=\"background:#fff3c4;font-weight:600;\">deliveries</span> in mid-November if a building permit is approved in time.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:28px;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#8b95a1;\">3</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#191f28;\">Up to twenty-one drones will fly from a <span style=\"background:#fff3c4;font-weight:600;\">warehouse</span> in the city, and each one can carry a package that <span style=\"background:#fff3c4;font-weight:600;\">weighs</span> up to five pounds to homes within seven and a half miles.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:28px;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#8b95a1;\">4</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#191f28;\"><span style=\"background:#fff3c4;font-weight:600;\">Supporters</span> say the service could save people a trip to the store, since some orders may arrive in as little as thirty minutes.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:28px;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#8b95a1;\">5</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#191f28;\">However, the drones, which drop each package from about twelve feet above the ground, make a noise that a company manager himself <span style=\"background:#fff3c4;font-weight:600;\">compared</span> to a vacuum cleaner or a lawn mower.<span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:6px;background:#ffeeee;color:#f04452;margin-left:6px;\">B2</span></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:28px;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#8b95a1;\">6</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#191f28;\">A city official has also raised <span style=\"background:#fff3c4;font-weight:600;\">concerns</span> that the city's thick tree cover could make many <span style=\"background:#fff3c4;font-weight:600;\">neighborhoods</span> hard to serve, which means the service may not reach everyone.<span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:6px;background:#ffeeee;color:#f04452;margin-left:6px;\">B2</span></td></tr></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:18px;\"><tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" style=\"background:#3182f6;border-radius:14px;\">\n      <a href=\"https://read.wspace.ai.kr/en/2026-10-22/\" style=\"display:block;padding:16px 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;\">음성 듣고 해석 쓰러 가기</a>\n    </td></tr></table>\n  <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#8b95a1;text-align:center;\">문장별 음성, 0.8배속, 모범 해석은 웹에서 볼 수 있어요.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#8b95a1;\">출처: <a href=\"https://dronexl.co/2026/10/21/amazon-prime-air-tallahassee-mid-november-launch-mk30\" style=\"color:#4e5968;\">Amazon Targets Mid-November Tallahassee Drones. A Permit Is Pending (DroneXL, 2026-10-21)</a></p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"height:12px;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;padding:22px 20px;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#3182f6;\">STEP 2</p>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;\">주요 단어</h2>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">deliveries</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">배송들 (delivery의 복수)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">warehouse</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">창고, 물류 센터</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">weighs</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">무게가 ~이다 (weigh + -s)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">supporters</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">지지자들, 찬성하는 사람들</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">compared</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">비교했다 (compare A to B: A를 B에 비유하다)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">concerns</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">우려, 걱정 (concern의 복수)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">neighborhoods</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">동네들, 지역들</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"height:12px;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;padding:22px 20px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;\">오늘 주제 어땠어요?</h2>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4e5968;\">오늘은 미래 분야였어요. 한 번 누르면 사이트가 열리며 기록돼요.</p>\n  <a href=\"https://read.wspace.ai.kr/en/2026-10-22/?vote=up&amp;from=email#vote\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 6px 6px 0;padding:9px 14px;border:1px solid #e2e6ea;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#191f28;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://read.wspace.ai.kr/assets/vote-up.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:-4px;margin-right:4px;border:0;\">재밌었어요</a><a href=\"https://read.wspace.ai.kr/en/2026-10-22/?vote=down&amp;from=email#vote\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 6px 6px 0;padding:9px 14px;border:1px solid #e2e6ea;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#191f28;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://read.wspace.ai.kr/assets/vote-down.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:-4px;margin-right:4px;border:0;\">별로였어요</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:16px 8px 0;font-size:13px;color:#8b95a1;text-align:center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://read.wspace.ai.kr/en/archive/\" style=\"color:#4e5968;\">지난 지문 모아 보기</a>\n  <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#8b95a1;\">매일 아침 B1~B2 영어 지문을 보내 드려요.<br>\n  수준이나 언어를 바꾸고 싶으면 <a href=\"https://read.wspace.ai.kr/en/#subscribe\" style=\"color:#8b95a1;\">여기</a>에서 같은 이메일로 다시 구독해 주세요. 확인 메일 없이 바로 바뀌어요.<br>\n  더 받지 않으려면 <a href=\"{{ unsubscribe_url }}\" style=\"color:#8b95a1;\">수신거부</a>를 눌러 주세요.</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>"}